[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_MIL_SHADOW]
Sights in the Dark

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_MIL_SHADOW_desc]
The eyes of King Sombra will be everywhere, in the dark, only the eyes of the shadow can see everything.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_MIL_SHADOW]
黑暗中的视线

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_MIL_SHADOW_desc]
